  "published": "2026-06-28T23:21:23.99Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.4.0 adds optional ILogger diagnostics to SolanaWsClient - pass an ILoggerFactory to surface connection drops, reconnects, subscription replays, and unsubscribe/dispose failures (a no-op NullLogger by default, so behaviour is unchanged without one) - and makes the internal JSON-RPC envelope (RpcRequests, RpcRequest, RpcResponse, RpcError) internal. Follows semantic versioning; while on 0.x, minor releases may carry breaking changes. Changelog: https://github.com/jecacs/SolSharp/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
